  "event013.Kyle01": "~ H-E-L-L-O ~",
  "event013.Ayeisha02": "Err... $2#$b#You don't have a mailbox and I have some small packets here for you.",
  "event013.Kyle02": "~ T-H-A-N-K Y-O-U ~$6",
  "event013.Ayeisha03": "Erm... $2#$b#Should I just leave them on the counter? $2",
  "event013.Kyle03": "~ Y-E-S P-L-E-A-S-E ~$6",
  "event013.Ayeisha04": "OK, I've left them on the counter for you.$2#$b#Hopefully next time I pop in we can meet face to face!",
