//--Evelyn After Delivery

  "event014.Evelyn01": "Ayeisha!",
  "event014.Evelyn02": "Sorry dear, give me a few seconds!",
  "event014.Evelyn03": "Good morning dear.",
  "event014.Ayeisha01": "Good morning Evelyn. Can I help you?",
  "event014.Evelyn04": "No no no. I'm just baking today and I have an extra cookie, I thought you'd like.$1",
  "event014.Ayeisha02": "That's sweet of you and little snacks always give me a boost on long walks.",
  "event014.Ayeisha03": "Thank you.",
  "event014.Evelyn05": "I'll tell you the recipe one day.$1#$b#Oh my! I think I smell something burning, I better go inside. Have a nice day dear.",
  "event014.Ayeisha04": "Bye Evelyn.",
  "event014.Ayeisha05": "WHAT WAS THAT?! $6",
  "event014.Ayeisha06": "...and it stole my cookie! $2",

//--Kent Delivery
  "event015.Ayeisha01": "Hello Kent! Here's your family's mail for today.",
  "event015.Kent01": "Thanks Ayeisha$h#$b#How's work going?",
  "event015.Ayeisha02": "Work is going well thanks.#$b#Altough we have caught a lot of suspicious packages at the depot lately.$s",
  "event015.Kent02": "...Oh? What kind of things?",
  "event015.Ayeisha03": "Just prohibited items, a few of them dangerous.$s#$b#People really do try to send -anything- in the mail.#$b#But I must dash, I've got quite a lot left to deliver.",
  "event015.Kent03": "...Heh. People can be... careless.$s",
  "event015.Ayeisha04": "They can. See you later.",
  "event015.Kent04": "Bye Ayeisha.",

//--Tilly Return to Sender
  "event016.Tilly01": "Ayeisha!",
  "event016.Tilly02": "Hi, Ayeisha! I got the two packages you delivered to my house earlier.$16#$b#Sadly, one of them is just a duplicate order I made by mistake.$s#$b#Can I give it to you now to return to sender?",
  "event016.Ayeisha01": "Hi. Yes that's fine, as long as it's not been opened.",
  "event016.Tilly03": "Thanks, you're a star.$h",
  "event016.Ayeisha02": "May I ask what the duplicate order was?",
  "event016.Tilly04": "It was a copy of 'Dewey Decimal Classification Volume 53' by the Ferngill Republic Lexicographical Society.$h",
  "event016.Ayeisha03": "Ah, I can see why you don't need two copies of that.$s",
  "event016.Tilly05": " I definitely don't and I have no idea who else would even want Volume 1.$h",
  "event016.Tilly06": "Thanks for stopping by, Ayeisha.$h#$b#I have to get back to shelving returned books. I'll see you later.$16",
  "event016.Ayeisha04": "See you later.",

