//EVENTS
//--Spring and Autumn  Seed Gift

  "Ayeisha.Event.Farm01": "Hi @. I have a left over pack of blue jazz seeds and I thought you could make use of them.[429]",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Farm02": "Hello @. I have a spare pack of fairy rose seeds and I thought the bees on your farm would love them.[425]",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Farm03": "Hey @!!! I have an odd question for you.$s#$b#Have seen any strange creatures around lately?$s",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Farm04": "Yes, I have!",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Farm05": "No, I haven't!",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Farm06": "Only Linus.",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Farm07": "Really?!$u#$b#I think I may have seen it too then!$h#$b#I saw this strange creature go into some bushes near my van this morning.#$b#I thought I'd let you know in case it damaged your crops.",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Farm08": "Oh?$s#$b#I thought I saw this strange creature go into some bushes near my van this morning.$s#$b#I thought I'd let you know in case it damaged your crops.$s",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Farm09": "....$a#$b#...So I thought I saw this strange creature go into some bushes near my van this morning.$s#$b#I thought I'd let you know in case it damaged your crops.$s",

//Forest

  "Ayeisha.Event.Forest01":  "Earlier Today...",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Forest02": "Odd.$s",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Forest03": "I wonder why I had to deliver 5 packages to this house today.$s#$b#Nobody has lived here for years.$s",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Forest04": "I hope someone isn't playing a trick on me.$s",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Forest05": "Well I've done a good job and the packages should be safe.",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Forest06": "Now I just need to trek back into town. Hopefully I will find some nice forage on the way.$h",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Forest07": "Don't Worry!",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Forest08": "The boxes are water proof!",

//Bus Stop

  "Ayeisha.Event.Bustop01": "*Grumble Grumble*",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Bustop02": "Oh! Hi @. Sorry if you overheard my grumbling.$2#$b#I just noticed I have been given some packages for Ridgeside, which is not part of my route.$2#$b#I'll just have to take them back to the sorting office when I'm done for the day.$2",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Bustop03": "I'll deliver them for you!",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Bustop04": "I'd like to help, but I'm a bit too busy right now.",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Bustop05": "That's not my problem, you deal with it.",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Bustop06": "Hmmm, I'm not supposed to do this, but it would be a great help if you could.",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Bustop07": "Those are the packages, none of them need to be signed for so you don't need to do anything special.#$b#Thanks for the help, it will save me some time when I get back.",
  "Ayeisha.Event.Bustop08": "That's ok! I'm not supposed to hand out deliveries for other people.$s",

//MODIFIED VANILLA EVENTS (choseToBeKnown and choseToBeKnown_pennySpouse)

  "Event.Town.Robin01": "Okay... let's go.",
  "Event.Town.Robin02": "Hi there, neighbors... that's a nice new house you got there!",
  "Event.Town.Pam01": "Robin... I... I dunno what to say...$s#$b#This is a dream come true... it's all I've ever wanted.$s",
  "Event.Town.Penny01": "Robin, thank you so much...$s",
  "Event.Town.Robin03": "Hey, don't thank me! This was @'s idea... And he paid for the whole thing, too!^Hey don't thank me! This was @'s idea... And she paid for the whole thing, too!",
  "Event.Town.Penny02": "@... This is absolutely incredible...$7#$b#I... I don't know what else to say...$s",
  "Event.Town.Pam02": "This must have cost a fortune, @...$s#$b#...To be honest, this is kind of embarrassing. How can I ever repay you for this?$4",
  "Event.Town.Fork01": "It's a gift... no repayment needed.",
  "Event.Town.Fork02": "You can start by treating Penny better...",
  "Event.Town.Pam03": "...I'm sorry.$s",
  "Event.Town.Pam04": "I'll do whatever you say...$s",
  "Event.Town.Penny03": "Mom...$s",
  "Event.Town.Penny04": "Don't worry... I understand why you get angry sometimes. Your life hasn't been so easy...$s",
  "Event.Town.Pam05": "Thanks, kid.$h#$b#From now on we'll be like a real family... you hear?#$b#I don't wanna be so bitter all the time anymore...$s#$b#I'm gonna try to turn my life around...",

  "Event.Town.Robin04": "Okay... let's go.",
  "Event.Town.Robin05": "Hi there, neighbors... that's a nice new house you got there!$4",
  "Event.Town.Pam06": "Robin... I... I dunno what to say...$s#$b#This is a dream come true... it's all I've ever wanted.$s",
  "Event.Town.Penny05": "@? What are you doing here?",
  "Event.Town.Robin06": "What, you didn't tell your wife about this, @?$u",
  "Event.Town.Robin07": "@ came up with this idea and paid for the whole thing!",
  "Event.Town.Penny06": "@... you didn't need to do this...#$b#But, thank you. This means a lot to me.$s",
  "Event.Town.Pam07": "This must have cost a fortune, @...$s#$b#...To be honest, this is kind of embarrassing. How can I ever repay you for this?$4",
  "Event.Town.Fork03": "...",
  "Event.Town.Fork04": "You're my 'Mom'!. No repayment needed!",
  "Event.Town.Fork05": "You can start by treating Penny better...",
  "Event.Town.Pam08": "...I'm sorry.$s",
  "Event.Town.Pam09": "I'll do whatever you say...$s",
  "Event.Town.Penny07": "Mom...$s",
  "Event.Town.Penny08": "Don't worry... I understand why you get angry sometimes. Your life hasn't been so easy...$s",
